{"id":"642192","name":"泡菜萝卜","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/642192/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"苹果","amount":"半个"},{"name":"彩虹梨","amount":"半个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"买了一个7斤多的大萝卜。","img":"images/642192/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净切丁。","img":"images/642192/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/642192/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"拌匀腌制。","img":"images/642192/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"腌了3小时，出来好多水。","img":"images/642192/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取一些洗净浮盐，撰干水分备用。","img":"images/642192/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"韭菜洗净切段。","img":"images/642192/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放萝卜丁里。","img":"images/642192/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放虾皮。","img":"images/642192/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大蒜处理干净。","img":"images/642192/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"捣成泥。","img":"images/642192/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"苹果洗净去皮。","img":"images/642192/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"梨洗净去皮。","img":"images/642192/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"苹果和梨切片，姜切片。","img":"images/642192/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"姜、梨及苹果捣碎。","img":"images/642192/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放萝卜里。","img":"images/642192/step_16.jpeg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放鱼露。","img":"images/642192/step_17.jpeg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放辣酱面和辣酱。","img":"images/642192/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"放白糖。","img":"images/642192/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/642192/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"带手套，用手拌匀。","img":"images/642192/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"很诱人的吧。","img":"images/642192/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/642192/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"想吃辣就多放点辣椒面。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}